<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia jobs data backs budget figures-govt.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia jobs data backs budget figures-govt.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Thursday official jobs data for January showed budget forecasts for jobs growth was on track.</p>
<p>&quot;All Australians ... will welcome the news today in relation to employment and will welcome the fact that those budget forecasts are on track and, as it turns out, there is every reason to believe they will be met if not more so,&quot; Costello told parliamett.</p>
</text>
